OL,3,ADad's house rammed before son died in
OL,4,AA66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said that morning, and the
OL,7,Fprevious night, it had received
OL,8,Fmultiple reports of two cars driving
OL,9,Fdangerously around the town and a Volvo
OL,10,FXC60, believed to be linked to the
OL,11,FPassat, was seen ramming properties in
OL,12,Fthe town.
OL,14,FThere is no suggestion the
OL,15,F17-year-old's father was involved in
OL,16,Fcriminal activity.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
