OL,3,ACanada to announce response to Trump
OL,4,Atariff threat as trade war escalates
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada will soon announce its response
OL,7,Fto the threat of US tariffs as a trade
OL,8,Fwar between the two countries escalates
OL,9,F- here's what we've heard so far
OL,11,FOfficials will outline the measures to
OL,12,F"protect and support Canadian workers
OL,13,Fand businesses" at a press conference
OL,14,Fat 11:00 ET (16:00 BST)
OL,16,FUS President Donald Trump yesterday
OL,17,Fthreatened to hike tariffs on Canadian
OL,18,Fvehicles to 50% from 1 January
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
