OL,3,ACanada to announce response to Trump
OL,4,Atariff threat as trade war escalates
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,7,Fsaid the move is "not a surprise" and
OL,8,Faccused Trump of trying to "destroy"
OL,9,Fthe country's auto industry - their
OL,10,Frelationship has deteriorated
OL,11,Fsignificantly
OL,13,FThe US announced a 50% tariff on a
OL,14,Frange of Canadian goods after trade
OL,15,Ftalks collapsed at the weekend
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
